            "At the origin both contributions point in the +x direction (away from +q, toward −q), so they add. Each has magnitude kq/r² = (8.99 × 10⁹)(4.0 × 10⁻⁹)/(0.030)² ≈ 4.0 × 10⁴ N/C, so E = 2 × 4.0 × 10⁴ ≈ 8.0 × 10⁴ N/C in the +x direction.",
