            "Full credit: ΔU ≈ −2.9 × 10⁻¹⁶ J; bar charts with K = 0 at A, equal total energy at A and B, and the drop in U<sub>E</sub> equal to the gain in K; v ≈ 5.9 × 10⁵ m/s."
